package com.lightningkite.kiteui

// The port the cross-platform network tests expect :test-server on.
//
// Under Gradle this file was generated by :library:generateTestServerPort so that the build and
// the tests could not disagree, and `-Pkiteui.testServerPort` reached both. The Kotlin Toolchain
// has no equivalent: it does not start the server either (that was a Gradle build service), so
// the server is started by hand with `./kotlin run -m test-server` and the port is fixed here.
internal const val TEST_SERVER_PORT: Int = 18787
